1
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:08,717
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't tell me you're...</font>

2
00:00:10,085 --> 00:00:12,411
<font color="#FFFFFF">It appears that you've remembered...</font>

3
00:00:14,438 --> 00:00:16,435
<font color="#FFFFFF">Have we met before...?</font>

4
00:00:18,432 --> 00:00:23,094
<font color="#FFFFFF">It looks like the freak beast's intelligence
is at the level of a beast too...</font>

5
00:00:23,923 --> 00:00:28,086
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well... I'll make you remember soon...</font>

6
00:00:38,369 --> 00:00:39,697
<font color="#FFFFFF">Itachi...</font>

7
00:00:42,333 --> 00:00:49,252
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ah, so he is that brat...
who killed his entire clan.</font>

8
00:00:51,418 --> 00:00:54,913
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's been a while, Mr. Kakashi, Naruto...</font>

9
00:00:58,068 --> 00:01:00,634
<font color="#FFFFFF">A Sharingan...
Just like Sasuke's!</font>

10
00:01:02,361 --> 00:01:05,955
<font color="#FFFFFF">He is the... one who's tormenting
Sasuke and Naruto.</font>

11
00:01:08,391 --> 00:01:10,148
<font color="#FFFFFF">You bastard...</font>

12
00:01:10,787 --> 00:01:13,044
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not just me, but Gaara too!</font>

13
00:01:40,739 --> 00:01:43,095
<font color="#FFFFFF">I will destroy you guys!</font>

14
00:01:49,285 --> 00:01:52,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">Everyone! Don't look directly
at his eyes! It's dangerous!</font>

15
00:03:26,728 --> 00:03:30,822
<font color="#FFFFFF">A Meeting with Destiny</font>

16
00:03:32,289 --> 00:03:33,617
<font color="#FFFFFF">So this is the Akatsuki!</font>

17
00:03:43,671 --> 00:03:46,397
<font color="#FFFFFF">Water Style:
Exploding Water Shock Wave!</font>

18
00:03:49,392 --> 00:03:50,260
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's coming!</font>

19
00:03:50,460 --> 00:03:51,229
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes!</font>

20
00:04:06,534 --> 00:04:08,401
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here I go!</font>

21
00:04:20,611 --> 00:04:22,778
<font color="#FFFFFF">Itachi's Genjutsu is Visual Jutsu.</font>

22
00:04:23,437 --> 00:04:26,402
<font color="#FFFFFF">Therefore, it's a type where one gets
caught by his sight,</font>

23
00:04:26,432 --> 00:04:28,169
<font color="#FFFFFF">so it'll be okay as long as we don't make
eye contact with him.</font>

24
00:04:28,529 --> 00:04:30,066
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, I know!</font>

25
00:04:30,525 --> 00:04:31,863
<font color="#FFFFFF">But then...</font>

26
00:04:32,362 --> 00:04:33,760
<font color="#FFFFFF">How should we fight him?</font>

27
00:04:38,552 --> 00:04:39,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well...</font>

28
00:04:41,777 --> 00:04:44,703
<font color="#FFFFFF">Guy, how did you fight with Itachi?</font>

29
00:04:45,102 --> 00:04:46,000
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

30
00:04:46,999 --> 00:04:48,397
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well...</font>

31
00:04:50,034 --> 00:04:53,928
<font color="#FFFFFF">Decipher his actions just by how
he moves his body and feet.</font>

32
00:05:04,271 --> 00:05:06,867
<font color="#FFFFFF">That seems pretty hard.</font>

33
00:05:07,805 --> 00:05:09,862
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Uchiha clan, eh?</font>

34
00:05:10,331 --> 00:05:14,295
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's been a while since
I went up against a Sharingan.</font>

35
00:05:15,753 --> 00:05:18,189
<font color="#FFFFFF">You don't have to be that surprised.</font>

36
00:05:18,618 --> 00:05:22,881
<font color="#FFFFFF">There are a few fighting techniques
to counter this Visual Jutsu.</font>

37
00:05:23,780 --> 00:05:24,978
<font color="#FFFFFF">What should we do?</font>

38
00:05:25,107 --> 00:05:27,903
<font color="#FFFFFF">"If it's one against one,
then you must flee."</font>

39
00:05:28,003 --> 00:05:31,128
<font color="#FFFFFF">"If it's two against one,
then take the back."</font>

40
00:05:33,224 --> 00:05:34,323
<font color="#FFFFFF">Say what?</font>

41
00:05:34,662 --> 00:05:38,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know what "if it's one against one,
then flee" means right?</font>

42
00:05:38,855 --> 00:05:41,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">There is no way you can win.</font>

43
00:05:42,509 --> 00:05:44,876
<font color="#FFFFFF">But if it's two against one...</font>

44
00:05:46,044 --> 00:05:47,901
<font color="#FFFFFF">If it's two against one,</font>

45
00:05:47,941 --> 00:05:53,631
<font color="#FFFFFF">even if one is caught by the Genjutsu,
the other will take his back and hit him.</font>

46
00:05:53,661 --> 00:05:55,459
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then the Genjutsu will cease.</font>

47
00:05:56,687 --> 00:05:59,652
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even if that is impossible,</font>

48
00:05:59,921 --> 00:06:05,013
<font color="#FFFFFF">if you hit your teammate,
then you can end the Genjutsu.</font>

49
00:06:05,612 --> 00:06:09,636
<font color="#FFFFFF">So, if there is more than one of us,
then one will distract him.</font>

50
00:06:09,905 --> 00:06:12,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">The rest of us will constantly
attack him from the back</font>

51
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,997
<font color="#FFFFFF">where the Sharingan can't see.</font>

52
00:06:15,596 --> 00:06:16,594
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see.</font>

53
00:06:16,954 --> 00:06:20,249
<font color="#FFFFFF">Amazing, you know a lot from old age!</font>

54
00:06:25,710 --> 00:06:27,008
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then I'll take his back—</font>

55
00:06:27,038 --> 00:06:27,976
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wait!</font>

56
00:06:56,231 --> 00:06:57,489
<font color="#FFFFFF">Neji! Lee!</font>

57
00:06:57,828 --> 00:07:00,084
<font color="#FFFFFF">So... how is it?</font>

58
00:07:12,534 --> 00:07:15,060
<font color="#FFFFFF">Doesn't it remind you?</font>

59
00:07:23,916 --> 00:07:26,342
<font color="#FFFFFF">How can he let out this much water?</font>

60
00:07:26,781 --> 00:07:31,074
<font color="#FFFFFF">This technique requires
a huge amount of Chakra.</font>

61
00:07:31,973 --> 00:07:35,567
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi Sensei,
what do you mean by wait?</font>

62
00:07:37,394 --> 00:07:43,115
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you want to say my way of fighting
the Sharingan is wrong?</font>

63
00:07:43,484 --> 00:07:47,149
<font color="#FFFFFF">That would work
if it's an ordinary Genjutsu,</font>

64
00:07:47,977 --> 00:07:51,442
<font color="#FFFFFF">but it's a bit more complicated
in his case.</font>

65
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,339
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

66
00:07:54,037 --> 00:07:56,364
<font color="#FFFFFF">He uses Mangekyo Sharingan</font>

67
00:07:56,394 --> 00:07:59,459
<font color="#FFFFFF">which is a much stronger Visual Jutsu
than an ordinary Sharingan.</font>

68
00:08:00,657 --> 00:08:02,484
<font color="#FFFFFF">If you receive his Visual Jutsu,</font>

69
00:08:02,654 --> 00:08:05,779
<font color="#FFFFFF">then you will experience
his Genjutsu in a second.</font>

70
00:08:06,348 --> 00:08:09,772
<font color="#FFFFFF">In other words, even though it may seem
like a second to others,</font>

71
00:08:09,812 --> 00:08:15,104
<font color="#FFFFFF">the person who receives the Jutsu
will feel it for hours or days.</font>

72
00:08:15,802 --> 00:08:19,826
<font color="#FFFFFF">In my case, I roamed around in
his Jutsu for three days,</font>

73
00:08:19,856 --> 00:08:22,591
<font color="#FFFFFF">and lost consciousness
for more than a week.</font>

74
00:08:25,287 --> 00:08:28,542
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not a matter of ending
or not ending the Genjutsu.</font>

75
00:08:35,471 --> 00:08:40,193
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's troublesome...
Who exactly is this guy?</font>

76
00:08:40,692 --> 00:08:42,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Impressive Kakashi.</font>

77
00:08:42,759 --> 00:08:46,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">It seems you didn't suffer
my Tsukiyomi, Nightmare Realm, in vain.</font>

78
00:08:46,952 --> 00:08:49,508
<font color="#FFFFFF">That is not all that I know...</font>

79
00:08:52,074 --> 00:08:56,367
<font color="#FFFFFF">After you used the Visual Jutsu,
you were quite exhausted</font>

80
00:08:56,397 --> 00:08:59,232
<font color="#FFFFFF">and you ended the battle immediately
and tried to leave.</font>

81
00:09:01,059 --> 00:09:02,427
<font color="#FFFFFF">But Itachi...</font>

82
00:09:02,457 --> 00:09:06,321
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even for you, it is dangerous
to use that "eye" too much...</font>

83
00:09:07,419 --> 00:09:09,775
<font color="#FFFFFF">We did not come here to fight.</font>

84
00:09:10,245 --> 00:09:14,338
<font color="#FFFFFF">Unfortunately, anything more than
this is nonsense. Let's go.</font>

85
00:09:16,005 --> 00:09:19,060
<font color="#FFFFFF">In addition to using up quite
a lot of Chakra,</font>

86
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:23,753
<font color="#FFFFFF">it seems it comes with some risk
to your "eye" as well, Itachi.</font>

87
00:09:24,821 --> 00:09:29,084
<font color="#FFFFFF">From just one match,
you have analyzed it quite well.</font>

88
00:09:29,883 --> 00:09:31,011
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey Itachi.</font>

89
00:09:34,975 --> 00:09:38,998
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your eyesight...
How much has it weakened?</font>

90
00:09:53,245 --> 00:09:56,071
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi... Could it be that you...?</font>

91
00:10:14,741 --> 00:10:16,238
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where is he?</font>

92
00:10:23,157 --> 00:10:25,124
<font color="#FFFFFF">Guy Sensei! Tenten!</font>

93
00:10:40,429 --> 00:10:41,727
<font color="#FFFFFF">A Water Clone!</font>

94
00:10:42,566 --> 00:10:45,661
<font color="#FFFFFF">You didn't even have time to recall.</font>

95
00:11:09,622 --> 00:11:12,448
<font color="#FFFFFF">It seems like Itachi also has come
into contact with the enemy...</font>

96
00:11:13,776 --> 00:11:15,912
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kisame is in the middle of a fight.</font>

97
00:11:27,923 --> 00:11:28,692
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lee!</font>

98
00:11:29,221 --> 00:11:31,088
<font color="#FFFFFF">Leaf Rising Wind!</font>

99
00:11:31,417 --> 00:11:32,216
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

100
00:11:39,504 --> 00:11:41,102
<font color="#FFFFFF">8 Trigrams: Air Palm!</font>

101
00:11:52,653 --> 00:11:53,911
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's programmed.</font>

102
00:12:05,932 --> 00:12:07,529
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn! I let him get away!</font>

103
00:12:21,167 --> 00:12:22,764
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where did he go?</font>

104
00:12:27,127 --> 00:12:29,294
<font color="#FFFFFF">Neji, where's the enemy's location?</font>

105
00:12:30,722 --> 00:12:33,018
<font color="#FFFFFF">In front! He's coming up.</font>

106
00:12:33,847 --> 00:12:34,945
<font color="#FFFFFF">I found him!</font>

107
00:12:41,135 --> 00:12:45,368
<font color="#FFFFFF">Seriously... What troublesome brats.</font>

108
00:12:45,967 --> 00:12:47,425
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's so bothersome.</font>

109
00:12:48,423 --> 00:12:51,518
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Water Style Ninjutsu
and that big sword...</font>

110
00:12:52,257 --> 00:12:53,355
<font color="#FFFFFF">You are...!</font>

111
00:12:54,314 --> 00:12:58,307
<font color="#FFFFFF">It seems like you have
finally remembered.</font>

112
00:12:59,405 --> 00:13:01,802
<font color="#FFFFFF">I do feel like we have met somewhere.</font>

113
00:13:06,634 --> 00:13:08,990
<font color="#FFFFFF">You still can't remember, huh...</font>

114
00:13:09,629 --> 00:13:14,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">You really are good
at hurting people's feelings.</font>

115
00:13:15,649 --> 00:13:17,616
<font color="#FFFFFF">Until you recall...</font>

116
00:13:19,443 --> 00:13:23,037
<font color="#FFFFFF">I will take my time putting you
through pain.</font>

117
00:13:47,069 --> 00:13:52,560
<font color="#FFFFFF">I underestimated you back then.
But I'm not that pathetic.</font>

118
00:13:53,858 --> 00:13:57,152
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not going to work
the way it did before, you see.</font>

119
00:14:02,544 --> 00:14:07,396
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a huge mistake if you think
I'm the same as before!</font>

120
00:14:07,795 --> 00:14:10,291
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, I'll deal with him.</font>

121
00:14:12,987 --> 00:14:15,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">This happened before too.</font>

122
00:14:16,451 --> 00:14:21,114
<font color="#FFFFFF">Form the Manji.
You guys look after Tazuna.</font>

123
00:14:22,172 --> 00:14:24,309
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't get involved in the fight.</font>

124
00:14:24,408 --> 00:14:25,107
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

125
00:14:25,736 --> 00:14:27,863
<font color="#FFFFFF">And work as a team here.</font>

126
00:14:29,630 --> 00:14:33,594
<font color="#FFFFFF">Y-You mean another
non-fighting teamwork?</font>

127
00:14:34,392 --> 00:14:36,848
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. This time, cover me.</font>

128
00:14:38,985 --> 00:14:42,539
<font color="#FFFFFF">To be honest, I want to be cool
and say, "Go on ahead," but...</font>

129
00:14:43,807 --> 00:14:46,932
<font color="#FFFFFF">Against him,
even I can't contain him alone.</font>

130
00:15:12,531 --> 00:15:13,689
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's see...</font>

131
00:15:14,458 --> 00:15:19,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's time for a counterattack.
First, I'll get him off guard.</font>

132
00:15:19,879 --> 00:15:21,816
<font color="#FFFFFF">If I succeed, don't hesitate to attack.</font>

133
00:15:21,976 --> 00:15:23,014
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Roger!
- Roger!</font>

134
00:15:23,373 --> 00:15:27,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you think you'll get me
off guard that easily?</font>

135
00:15:27,736 --> 00:15:31,600
<font color="#FFFFFF">I will quickly change your mind.</font>

136
00:15:40,985 --> 00:15:41,844
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gentle Fist!</font>

137
00:15:57,958 --> 00:15:58,956
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see...</font>

138
00:15:59,116 --> 00:16:04,347
<font color="#FFFFFF">You swing that heavy sword so easily
and you don't get caught off guard.</font>

139
00:16:04,607 --> 00:16:06,304
<font color="#FFFFFF">If close battle does not work...</font>

140
00:16:18,754 --> 00:16:20,122
<font color="#FFFFFF">How's that?</font>

141
00:16:24,575 --> 00:16:26,811
<font color="#FFFFFF">Did you do something?</font>

142
00:16:28,209 --> 00:16:29,806
<font color="#FFFFFF">What an annoying sword.</font>

143
00:16:30,365 --> 00:16:32,362
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh yeah, that sword...!</font>

144
00:16:33,001 --> 00:16:34,928
<font color="#FFFFFF">Did you recall?</font>

145
00:16:35,627 --> 00:16:37,524
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's your weapon, huh?</font>

146
00:16:38,892 --> 00:16:40,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">You can tell by looking.</font>

147
00:16:40,250 --> 00:16:42,486
<font color="#FFFFFF">But there is a big difference
between knowing it</font>

148
00:16:42,516 --> 00:16:45,880
<font color="#FFFFFF">and really knowing it.</font>

149
00:16:46,110 --> 00:16:50,972
<font color="#FFFFFF">As expected Guy Sensei...
Each word holds a deep meaning.</font>

150
00:16:51,501 --> 00:16:56,423
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why now for god's sake?
Can you quit being amazed every time?</font>

151
00:16:56,563 --> 00:16:58,091
<font color="#FFFFFF">Forget it, Tenten.</font>

152
00:16:58,490 --> 00:17:01,855
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let me take back what I said.</font>

153
00:17:02,054 --> 00:17:05,379
<font color="#FFFFFF">It seems like your intelligence
is less than an animal.</font>

154
00:17:05,509 --> 00:17:06,278
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here we go!</font>

155
00:17:07,675 --> 00:17:10,371
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dynamic action!</font>

156
00:17:20,525 --> 00:17:23,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's about time for you to come with me...</font>

157
00:17:24,878 --> 00:17:26,146
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto.</font>

158
00:17:28,811 --> 00:17:29,909
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll go first!</font>

159
00:17:35,331 --> 00:17:36,459
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shadow Clone?</font>

160
00:17:40,452 --> 00:17:41,551
<font color="#FFFFFF">Rasengan!</font>

161
00:17:47,841 --> 00:17:49,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is also a Shadow Clone!</font>

162
00:18:02,717 --> 00:18:05,053
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sakura! Granny!</font>

163
00:18:07,649 --> 00:18:09,206
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sakura...?</font>

164
00:18:36,303 --> 00:18:37,231
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now!</font>

165
00:18:44,290 --> 00:18:46,017
<font color="#FFFFFF">Water Clone Jutsu!</font>

166
00:18:53,205 --> 00:18:53,934
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

167
00:19:02,091 --> 00:19:03,519
<font color="#FFFFFF">Water Prison Jutsu!</font>

168
00:19:05,316 --> 00:19:06,284
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn it!</font>

169
00:19:18,994 --> 00:19:21,130
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lee! Neji! Tenten!</font>

170
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:47,218
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi Sensei!</font>

171
00:19:59,728 --> 00:20:02,064
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's going on?</font>

172
00:21:37,471 --> 00:21:42,103
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hello kids, thanks for coming to
the Kisame aquarium today.</font>

173
00:21:42,133 --> 00:21:44,559
<font color="#FFFFFF">The show you've been waiting for
is about to begin.</font>

174
00:21:44,599 --> 00:21:47,295
<font color="#FFFFFF">The five sharks led by this aquarium's
fabulous leader</font>

175
00:21:47,325 --> 00:21:50,989
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shark Boy and Brother Guy.</font>

176
00:21:51,318 --> 00:21:52,986
<font color="#FFFFFF">Before that, here are some warnings.</font>

177
00:21:53,016 --> 00:21:56,011
<font color="#FFFFFF">Those in the front row should
watch out for the water splash.</font>

178
00:21:56,041 --> 00:21:58,806
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay everyone;
let's yell as loud as we can.</font>

179
00:21:59,106 --> 00:22:01,871
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay ready, Shark Boy!</font>

180
00:22:03,868 --> 00:22:05,925
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time: "Naruto's Growth"</font>

